Package: openmediavault-clouddrive2
Architecture: any
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0), fuse3
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault CloudDrive2 plugin
 Integrate the CloudDrive2 cloud-drive aggregation service into the
 OpenMediaVault web interface. The CloudDrive2 core binary is bundled
 in this architecture-specific package and runs as a systemd service
 managed through OpenMediaVault (enable/disable, start/stop/restart,
 configuration directory).
